Walking into a new church for the first time takes courage. We get it — and we want to make it as easy as possible.

## When you arrive

Look for the orange flags in the east lot. Someone from our welcome team will meet you at the door, help you find your way, and point you to the coffee.

## Kids

Our kids team has a safe, fun environment ready for children from birth through 5th grade. Check-in takes about two minutes.

## The service

We gather for about 75 minutes: we sing, we pray, and we open the Bible together. Come as you are — seriously.
